What this fork changes
----------------------
See FORK-CHANGES.md for the itemized list of modifications, and
EVIDENCE/ for the architecture reconstruction report, the originality
analysis of the modules written for this fork, and the build provenance log.

Trademark and naming
--------------------
"Filee" is the name the upstream project is distributed under. This fork does
not use that name, its logo, its website, its installer identity, its update
signing key, or its code signing certificate. The Windows installer GUID,
registry keys, data directories, update endpoint and single-instance mutex name
have all been replaced, so an installation of this fork and an installation of
upstream Filee can coexist on one machine without overwriting or uninstalling
one another.

